  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees.",
    "Wrap the ssam wraps in foil and warm them in the oven for 5 minutes.",
    "In a large bowl, combine the sliced Manchego cheese, smoked salmon, shredded lettuce, thinly sliced red onion, and pickled ginger.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the lemon juice and olive oil.",
    "Pour the lemon juice mixture over the cheese and salmon mixture, and toss to combine.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "To assemble the wraps, lay a warmed ssam wrap flat and fill with the cheese and salmon mixture.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
